cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this model in published work, please cite it, bandsolver, and
  Newman's description of the BAND method (Electrochemical Systems, Appendix C).
title: "lfp-model: a LiFePO4 porous-electrode half-cell model solved with Newman's BAND method"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: John
    family-names: Bernard
version: 0.4.0
